        <description>A note that the eruv boundary now turns at Bala Ave and no longer follows City Line Ave at that point. The sidewalk on the Bala Park side of Bala Ave is no longer within the eruv boundary up until Bala Park. The sidewalk on the OPPOSITE SIDE of Bala Park is included in the eruv boundary UP UNTIL this point</description>
